#. …悪かったわね、こんな時間に呼び出して。
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Sorry for asking you to meet with me so late."
msgstr ""

#. いや…もう慣れたよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's okay. I'm used to it."
msgstr ""

#. …そう。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...Indeed."
msgstr "...Chuẩn là vậy."

#. じゃあ、さっそく本題に入りましょうか。
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well then, let me get straight to the point."
msgstr ""

#. その本題って、監視カメラがある所では
#. 話せない事なんだよね？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's something you can't talk about in front\n"
"of the surveillance cameras, right?"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、それって…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So does that mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんが、モノクマから
#. 何かを盗んだ事と関係しているんじゃない？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Does this have something to do with whatever it is\n"
"you stole from Monokuma?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. さっき、モノクマが言ってたんだよ。
#. 宝物が盗まれたとかって…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Monokuma told us earlier that someone had stolen\n"
"something from him."
msgstr ""

#. それって、霧切さんがやったんじゃないの？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Was it you...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. そうよ…私がやったのよ…
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Đúng vậy."

#. やっぱり、そうだったんだね…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So I was right..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、何を盗んだの？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But what did you steal?"
msgstr ""

#. これよ…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I stole this..."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>鍵<CLT>？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A...<CLT 3>key<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ただの鍵じゃないのは明らかだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But looking at it, I could tell it wasn't just any\n"
"key.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマの模様<CLT><CLT 4>が入った鍵…
#. 明らかに異質だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was shaped like <CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma<CLT><CLT 4>. It was probably the\n"
"only key of its kind on Earth.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どこで…これを…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Where did you get this...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>学園長室<CLT>よ。あそこから持って来たのよ…
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "From <CLT 3>the headmaster's room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. えっ！？　学園長室に忍び込んだの！？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!? You snuck into the headmaster's room!?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、あそこには、
#. 鍵が掛かってたはずじゃ…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...wasn't it locked?"
msgstr ""

#. 鍵は壊されていたわ…
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The lock was broken."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんよ…彼女がやってくれたのよ…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It was Sakura. She did it for us..."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんが…？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She did...?"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の遺書にあったでしょう？
#. <CLT 3>『我はただでは死なん、貴様に一矢報いる』<CLT>って…
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Remember what she said in her note? \"<CLT 3>I'm not going to\n"
"just lay down and die. I *will* fight you...<CLT>\""
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんがボクらの為に、
#. 学園長室のドアを壊してくれたって事？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...Sakura broke into the headmaster's room for us?"
msgstr ""

#. あの部屋に隠された秘密を、
#. 私達が調べられるようにね…
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's right. So that we could uncover whatever\n"
"secrets might lay hidden within..."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんが…ボクらの為に…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She did that...for us..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらの為に犯してくれた校則違反…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She violated the school regulations to help us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死を覚悟していた彼女だからこその、
#. 最後の校則違反…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She'd already decided to die, so her last act was to\n"
"defy the rules of this place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 鍵が壊されている事に気付いたのは、
#. 昨日の学級裁判が終わった後だったわ…
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I noticed the room was open after the class trial was\n"
"over yesterday."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、そのまま学園長室に入っても、
#. すぐにモノクマに気付かれてしまう。だから…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But if I'd just strolled into the room, Monokuma would\n"
"have noticed right away. Which is why..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたを囮にしたのよ…
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...I used you as a decoy."
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、昨日の夜、
#. ボクを情報処理室に呼び出したのって…
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So you asked me to meet you at the data center in\n"
"order to..."
msgstr ""

#. そう、モノクマの目を引き付けてもらう為…
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Correct. I wanted you to draw Monokuma's attention."
msgstr ""

#. その隙に、私は学園長室に忍び込んだの。
#. そして、その成果が…
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I took that opportunity to sneak into the headmaster's\n"
"room. And as a result..."
msgstr ""

#. この鍵なのよ…
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...I found this key."
msgstr ""

#. そう…だったんだ…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wow..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、もしかして、
#. 昨日言ってた事も学園長室で…？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then...what you told me about yesterday—did that come\n"
"from the headmaster's room, too?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Mukuro Ikusaba..."
msgstr ""

#. この学園に潜む１６人目の高校生…
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The sixteenth student, lying hidden somewhere in this\n"
"school..."
msgstr ""

#. “超高校級の絶望”と呼ばれる女子高校生…
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The one they call the Ultimate Despair..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろに気を付けて。
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Watch out for her."
msgstr ""

#. その<CLT 3>“戦刃むくろ”<CLT>って人の事も…
#. 学園長室で知ったとか？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Did you find out about this <CLT 3>Mukuro Ikusaba<CLT> while you\n"
"were in there?"
msgstr ""

#. “戦刃むくろ”に関するファイルを
#. 学園長室で見つけたの…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I did find a file in the headmaster's room that talked\n"
"about her, yes."
msgstr ""

#. 詳しい事は、まだわからないけど…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I don't know all the details yet, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろは<CLT 3>危険<CLT>よ…
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...one thing I do know, is that Mukuro Ikusaba is\n"
"<CLT 3>dangerous<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. き、危険って…？
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "D-Dangerous...?"
msgstr ""

#. もしかすると、彼女が黒幕なのかもしれない。
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "She may very well be the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. く、黒幕…ッ！？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "M-Mastermind!?"
msgstr ""

#. でもさ…アルターエゴは言ってたよね？
#. 黒幕は学園長の可能性が高いって…
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But didn't Alter Ego say that the headmaster was\n"
"probably the mastermind?"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ…学園長は黒幕じゃないわ。
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No...the headmaster isn't the mastermind, I'm sure of\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. まだ確信は持てないけど、
#. それは間違いない…
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I don't have proof yet, but I have no doubt I'm right."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確信が持てないのに断言するなんて…
#. 霧切さんにしては珍しいな…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To make such a strong statement without proof...\n"
"That's not like Kyoko at all."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、学園長が黒幕じゃないとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...if it isn't the headmaster...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろ…そいつが黒幕って事なのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...does that mean Mukuro Ikusaba really could be the\n"
"mastermind?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、この鍵は私達がようやく手に入れた
#. 最大のチャンスよ…
msgctxt "0060 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, this key is the one big opportunity we've been\n"
"waiting to get our hands on."
msgstr ""

#. 逃す訳にはいかないでしょ？
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Now that we've grasped it, we can't let it go, can we?"
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、そもそも、
#. その鍵って、どこの鍵なの？
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sure, but I mean...what's this key even unlock?"
msgstr ""

#. 今はまだわからない。だから…
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I don't know yet. Which is why..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたがモノクマの目を引き付けている隙に、
#. これから、私がそれを確かめるのよ…
msgctxt "0064 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...I need you to draw Monokuma's attention again,\n"
"while I go and find out."
msgstr ""

#. また…どこかに忍び込むって事…？
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, so you're planning on sneaking back in again?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの…危険過ぎるよ！
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You can't! That's way too dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. それに、モノクマの目を引き付けろって言うけど、
#. 黒幕が１人とは限らないはずだよ？
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And you want me to draw his attention, but we don't\n"
"actually know there's just one mastermind, right?"
msgstr ""

#. もし、黒幕が複数人でボクらを監視してたら…
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If there's more than one person watching us..."
msgstr ""

#. …でも、昨日の夜はバレなかったわよね？
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But they didn't catch on last night, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それは、たまたま…
#. そうだっただけかもしれないし…
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe we just got lucky..."
msgstr ""

#. もしかしたら、黒幕は私達の監視とモノクマの操作を
#. <CLT 3>同時に行えない<CLT>のかもしれない…
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Or maybe the mastermind can't monitor us and control\n"
"Monokuma <CLT 3>at the same time<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. だから、昨日の夜はバレなかった…
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Like I said, we didn't get caught last night."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、あなたの言う通り、
#. たまたまって可能性もあるわね。
msgctxt "0074 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But as you said, maybe it was pure luck."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、同じ事をもう１度やってみるのよ。
msgctxt "0075 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Which is why we're going to run the experiment one\n"
"more time."
msgstr ""

#. そして、もし今度も成功するようなら…
msgctxt "0076 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And if we're successful again..."
msgstr ""

#. 私の推論は、ただの推論じゃなくなるわ…
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...then what may have just been a lucky guess will be\n"
"proven true."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは淡々と唇を動かし続けていた。
#. そして、ボクはそれを黙って聞いていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As Kyoko talked, she was calm and collected as ever. I\n"
"couldn't help but just stand there and listen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕が、私達の監視とモノクマの操作を
#. 同時に行えないとなると…
msgctxt "0079 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If it's true that the mastermind can't watch us and\n"
"control Monokuma at the same time..."
msgstr ""

#. …私達にも、つけ入る隙が生まれるはずよ。
msgctxt "0080 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...then there would have to be a period of time where\n"
"the mastermind is vulnerable."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、それを見極める為の行動でもあるのよ。
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What we need to do is find out for sure if that's\n"
"actually true, and if we can exploit it."
msgstr ""

#. でも…やっぱり…
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe, but..."
msgstr "<CLT 26>Có thể, nhưng mà...<CLT>"

#. いくらなんでもリスクが大き過ぎるよ。
#. もし、失敗した時の事を考えると…
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No matter what the reward, the risk is just too high.\n"
"When I think what might happen if we fail..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな心配をする必要はないはずよ。
#. だって、思い出してみて…
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't think you need to worry all that much. After\n"
"all..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>希望ヶ峰学園について調べるのは自由です。
#. 特に行動に制限は課せられません。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>With minimal restrictions, you are free to explore\n"
"Hope's Peak Academy at your discretion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Với những hạn chế tối thiểu, các bạn được tự do khám phá Học\n"
"viện Đỉnh Đỉnh Hy Vọng theo ý muốn của mình.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 謎を解く為の行動に制限は課せられない…
#. そうあったはずよ？
msgctxt "0086 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No restrictions have been placed on our efforts to\n"
"solve the mystery, am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、校則を破ろうとしている訳じゃない。
#. 鍵を盗んだ行為だってそうよ。
msgctxt "0087 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Even when I took the key, I didn't break any rules as\n"
"far as I can tell."
msgstr ""

#. でも、黒幕がその気になったら、
#. 校則なんて関係ないよ…
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if the mastermind decides to do something, all the\n"
"rules in the world won't matter."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、問答無用でボクらを殺そうとするはずだよ！
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He could just kill us all without a second thought!"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどね…計画が失敗した場合でも、
#. それを確かめる事が出来るわね。
msgctxt "0090 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I see... In that case, even if the plan fails, we'll\n"
"still be able to prove or disprove that hypothesis."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. いざという時、黒幕は校則を破るのか？
#. それとも、あくまで校則にこだわるのか？
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In a moment of crisis, will the mastermind break their\n"
"own rules, or adhere to them no matter what?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、成功しても失敗しても得るものがある計画…
#. 尚更、やらない理由はないわよね？
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In other words, we gain something whether we succeed\n"
"or not. Now there's no reason not to do it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけど…ッ！！
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But—!"
msgstr ""

#. 先に進む為には、
#. 危険を避けては通れない…
msgctxt "0095 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you spend all your time trying to avoid danger,\n"
"you'll never move forward."
msgstr ""

#. 危険は承知の上よ。
#. それでも謎が解けるなら進むべき…
msgctxt "0096 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We know the danger. But if that risk means solving the\n"
"mystery, we have no choice."
msgstr ""

#. …そうでしょう？
msgctxt "0097 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr "...Tôi nói sai sao?"

#. <CLT 4>その時になって、ボクはようやく気が付いた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>At that moment, I finally realized...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの目に、悲壮感や怯えは一切なかった。
#. むしろ彼女は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I had never seen the slightest hint of fear or\n"
"despair in Kyoko's eyes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>立ち向かうべき敵…立ち向かうべき謎…
#. それらを目の前にして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her gaze was firmly fixed on the mystery ahead, the\n"
"enemy standing before us. And with that in view...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…笑っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...she just smiled.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私の気は変わらない…
#. 変えるつもりもないわ…
msgctxt "0102 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I can't change how I feel, and wouldn't if I could."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで、霧切さんは懐から何かを取り出すと、
#. それをボクに差し出した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then Kyoko took something from her coat pocket and\n"
"held it out to me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え？　これって…？
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What's this?"
msgstr ""

#. 決意表明ってところかしら。
#. 今はまだ開けないで。それを開けるのは…
msgctxt "0105 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Consider it a symbol of my determination. Don't open\n"
"it yet. Only open it..."
msgstr ""

#. …私にもしもの事があった時よ。
msgctxt "0106 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...if something ever happens to me."
msgstr ""

#. も、もしもの事って…！
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-If something happens!?"
msgstr ""

#. 念の為に渡しておくだけよ…
#. 万が一の可能性でも、犬死なんてごめんだから…
msgctxt "0108 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I'm not planning on dying. But there's always a chance\n"
"of it, and a death without meaning is...unappealing."
msgstr ""

#. …お願い。預かってもらいたいの。
msgctxt "0109 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Please, I want you to hold on to it for me."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、預かるだけ…預かっておくけど…
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Fine. I'll hold on to it, just because you asked me\n"
"to."
msgstr ""

#. でも、後で絶対に返すからね！
#. 絶対だよ！
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I'm gonna give it back at some point, you can be\n"
"sure of that!"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ…わかってるわ…
msgctxt "0112 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Yes...of course."
msgstr ""

#. それと、最後にもう１つだけ。
msgctxt "0113 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Oh, and one more thing."
msgstr ""

#. この件は、他のみんなには、
#. まだ内緒にしておいて欲しいの…
msgctxt "0114 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You can't tell anyone else about what I've discovered."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕に隠し通すのが、難しくなるから…？
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Sure, because then there's a chance the mastermind\n"
"might find out, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それも…あるわね…
msgctxt "0116 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well...there's that, too."
msgstr ""

#. それも…って他に何が…？
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...? You mean...there's something else?"
msgstr ""

#. 大した事じゃないわ、忘れて…
msgctxt "0118 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's nothing. Forget I said anything."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、そう簡単に忘れられないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I-I can't just forget that easily...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、そろそろ始めましょうか。
msgctxt "0120 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Okay then, shall we begin?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、頼んだわよ。
msgctxt "0121 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm counting on you, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの目を引き付ければいいんだね？
#. わかったよ…やってみる…
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I just have to get Monokuma's attention, right? Well,\n"
"I'll give it my best shot..."
msgstr ""

#. 私は先に行くわね。後はよろしく…
msgctxt "0123 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm going on ahead. The rest is up to you..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつもと変わらず、
#. 素っ気ない別れのあいさつだけを残し…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her curt goodbye was no different from any other time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつもと変わらず、
#. 彼女は足早に立ち去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And like every other time, she moved at a brisk pace\n"
"as she left.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ、いつもと違うのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What *wasn't* like every other time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の背中を見送るボクの…
#. その胸に沸き上がる妙な不安…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...was the sudden knot I felt in my stomach as I\n"
"watched her walk away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや、大丈夫に決まってる！
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...everything's gonna be fine, I know it...!"
msgstr ""

#. だって…あの霧切さんなんだし…
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Because it's Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不安を振り払うかのように、
#. そんな独り言を発した後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Talking to myself helped shake off some of my\n"
"anxiety...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは行動を開始した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and then I got to work.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The locker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴも…もういないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Alter Ego...isn't here anymore.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Alter Ego... không còn ở đây nữa rồi.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ひとまず、霧切さんの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For now, I should hear what Kyoko wants to tell me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>マッサージチェアがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The massage chair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Chiếc ghế massage...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>随分、古い感じだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be pretty old.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ひとまず、霧切さんの話を聞こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For now, I should hear what Kyoko wants to tell me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
